                                "sense_id": "09bcb3ba-4e75-3c7d-9e7d-cd998601f40c",
                                "text": "The initial reaction under UV excitation produces a ketyl radical from the benzophenone, which is inactive, and an alkylamino radical from the tertiary amine, which is very reactive."
